{
  "_comment": "NOT ACTIVE, and intentionally so: Claude's permission classifier refuses to write .claude/settings.json (including via /update-config) because that file governs Claude's own permissions. Apply it yourself: cp .claude/settings.recommended.json .claude/settings.json (then drop this _comment key), or set the rules via /permissions. These are workflow guardrails for Claude's built-in tools, NOT OS-level secret isolation -- see .claude/ORCHESTRATION_LAYER.md. Your untracked .claude/settings.local.json is separate and unaffected.",
